            Signing verification. Cert PEM is baked from deployment/ota/certs/certificate.pem
            via deployment/ota/scripts/sync-signing-cert.js. CI runs the same script in check
            mode to block commits that let the two drift. See deployment/ota/README.md for the
            full rotation procedure.
        -->
